<title>USA: Regency Realty names Stein chairman.</title>
<headline>Regency Realty names Stein chairman.</headline>
<text>
<p>JACKSONVILLE, Fla., June 16 - Regency Realty Corp said Monday it elected its president and chief executive officer Martin Stein Jr to the additional post of chairman.</p>
<p>Martin Stein Jr succeeds Joan Wellhouse Stein, who will become chairman emeritus. Joan Stein founded Regency with her late husband Martin Stein Sr. in 1963.</p>
</text>
